[[Juniper Bark]]s are [[plant]] [[creature]]s that populate the [[Shiverpeak Mountains]]. They spend most of their time just below the surface of the ground, but pop up to attack when enemies come near. While not particularly dangerous by themselves, when they appear during a battle with other, more dangerous creatures, they cease to be a mere nuisance and become a true threat.

